},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Enricher"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered.","type":"text"}],"title":"Enricher","url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Enricher"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"type":"topic","title":"Destinations","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations","abstract":[{"text":"Where tracked events go: the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"}}}